<title>SWITZERLAND: RESEARCH ALERT - CSFB repeats Zurich buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - CSFB repeats Zurich buy.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>CSFB repeated its buy recommendation for shares of Zurich Group and set a 12-month price target of 650 Swiss francs per share.</p>
<p>Analyst Kishore Banger said in a research note that Zurich's acquisition of U.S. asset manager Scudder, Stevens &amp; Clark would strengthen the group's core business and stabilise earnings, especially in the United States.</p>
<p>&quot;We are sticking to our buy recommendation,&quot; it said.</p>
<p>-- Zurich newsroom +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
